    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce consistent comma spacing",
    "description" : "This rule enforces consistent spacing before and after commas in TypeScript code, including support for trailing commas in type parameter lists.",
    "explanation" : "---\ndescription: 'Enforce consistent spacing before and after commas.'\n---\n\n> 🛑 This file is source code, not the primary documentation location! 🛑\n>\n> See **https://typescript-eslint.io/rules/comma-spacing** for documentation.\n\nThis rule extends the base [`eslint/comma-spacing`](https://eslint.org/docs/rules/comma-spacing) rule.\nIt adds support for trailing comma in a types parameters list.",
