  {
    "id" : "vue_no-multiple-template-root",
    "level" : "High",
    "category" : "ErrorProne",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Multiple Root Nodes in Vue Template",
    "description" : "This rule enforces that Vue templates have only a single root element, which is required for Vue 2 compatibility.",
    "explanation" : "---\npageClass: rule-details\nsidebarDepth: 0\ntitle: vue/no-multiple-template-root\ndescription: disallow adding multiple root nodes to the template\nsince: v7.0.0\n---\n# vue/no-multiple-template-root\n\n> disallow adding multiple root nodes to the template\n\n- :gear: This rule is included in all of `\"plugin:vue/essential\"`, `\"plugin:vue/strongly-recommended\"` and `\"plugin:vue/recommended\"`.\n\n## :book: Rule Details\n\nThis rule checks whether template contains single root element valid for Vue 2.\n\n<eslint-code-block :rules=\"{'vue/no-multiple-template-root': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- The root is text -->\n<template>Lorem ipsum</template>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block :rules=\"{'vue/no-multiple-template-root': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- There are multiple root elements -->\n<template>\n  <div>hello</div>\n  <div>hello</div>\n</template>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block :rules=\"{'vue/no-multiple-template-root': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- The root element has `v-for` directives -->\n<template>\n  <div v-for=\"item in items\"/>\n</template>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n<eslint-code-block :rules=\"{'vue/no-multiple-template-root': ['error']}\">\n\n```vue\n<!-- The root element is `<template>` or `<slot>` -->\n<template>\n  <slot />\n</template>\n```\n\n</eslint-code-block>\n\n## :wrench: Options\n\nNothing.\n\n## :rocket: Version\n\nThis rule was introduced in eslint-plugin-vue v7.0.0\n\n## :mag: Implementation\n\n- [Rule source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/lib/rules/no-multiple-template-root.js)\n- [Test source](https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue/blob/master/tests/lib/rules/no-multiple-template-root.js)",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
